\ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'ecnh (bao g\u7891\'3fm v\u7889\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng, v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\u7873\'3f \'f0
\u7847\'3fu t\'fd x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn, v\u7889\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn v\'e0 c\'e1c qu\u7929\'3f x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp) \'f0\u7875\'3f ph\u7909\'3fc v\u7909\'3f k\u7883\'3fp th\u7901\'3fi c\'e1c y
