\u7901\'3fi s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn kh\'e1c \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'f9 \'f0\u7855\'3fp, sau \'f0\'f3 ph\u7843\'3fi ho\'e0n tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 \ltrch\fcs0 \f605\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 2/ Ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f c\u7845\'3fp v\u7889\'3fn ban \'f0\u7847\'3fu m\u7897\'3ft l\u7847\'3fn (\'d0i\u7873\'3fu 18):
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 Ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp bao g\u7891\'3fm:
\par - V\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp m\u7897\'3ft l\u7847\'3fn khi x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp m\u7899\'3fi b\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0o ho
\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng.
\par N\u7871\'3fu x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\'fda v\'e0o ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng t\u7915\'3fng b\u7897\'3f ph\u7853\'3fn theo lu\u7853\'3fn ch\u7913\'3fng kinh t\u7871\'3f k\u7929\'3f thu\u7853\'3ft th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
