c x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh v\'e0 c\u7845\'3fp ph\'e1t theo t\u7915\'3fng \'f0\u7907\'3ft t\'fd\'f5ng \u7913\'3fng v\u7899\'3fi}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 \ltrch\fcs0 \f605\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901  c\'f4ng su\u7845\'3ft th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f
