\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 - V\u7889\'3fn x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp t\u7921\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung h\'e0ng n\'e3m t\u7915\'3f qu\u7929\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu
\u7845\'3ft tr\'edch t\u7915\'3f l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 - V\u7889\'3fn vay Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng, k\u7875\'3f c\u7843\'3f vay b\u7857\'3fng ngo\u7841\'3fi t\u7879\'3f.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 - C\'e1c kho\u7843\'3fn n\u7907\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\'e0 ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn kh\'e1c (nh\'fd \'f0}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
