\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp).
\par Khi m\u7899\'3fi b\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0o s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ph\u7843\'3fi x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng, tr}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'ecnh c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn c\'f9ng v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng c\'f9ng c
\u7845\'3fp x\'e9t duy\u7879\'3ft. K\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f 1/1/1988, \'f0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp m\u7899\'3fi \'f0i v\'e0o ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp \'f0\u7911\'3f v
\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc 1 l\u7847\'3fn theo c\'f4ng su\u7845\'3ft th\u7921\'3fc t\u7871\'3f huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng.
\par \'d0\u7889\'3fi v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0ang ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng, sau khi x\'e1c \'f0\u7883\'3fnh l\u7841\'3fi \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng theo m\u7863\'3ft b\u7857\'3fng gi\'e1 m
\u7899\'3fi, ph\u7847\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc thi\u7871\'3fu \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\u7893\'3f sung b\u7857\'3fng c\'e1c n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 \ltrch\fcs0 \f605\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 gu
\u7891\'3fn sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 a. Ch\'eanh l\u7879\'3fch gi\'e1 v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd h\'e0ng ho\'e1 ki\u7875\'3fm k\'ea t\u7891\'3fn kho theo Th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Ng\'e2n h
\'e0ng s\u7889\'3f 46 TT/LBTC-NH ng\'e0y 30/9/1987.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 \ltrch\fcs0 \f605\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 b. X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp t\u7921\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung b\u7857\'3fng qu\u7929\'3f khuy\u7871\'3fn kh\'edch ph\'e1t tri\u7875\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft tr\'edch t\u7915
\'3f l\u7907\'3fi nhu\u7853\'3fn \'f0\u7875\'3f l\u7841\'3fi x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp theo ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f h}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 i\u7879\'3fn h\'e0nh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 c. Huy \'f0\u7897\'3fng v\u7853\'3ft t\'fd \u7913\'3f \'f0\u7885\'3fng ra s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng.
\par d. C\'f5 quan ch\u7911\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ho\'e0 t\u7915\'3f n\'f5i th\u7915\'3fa \'f0\u7871\'3fn n\'f5i thi\u7871\'3fu (n\u7871\'3fu c\'f3) trong n\u7897\'3fi b\u7897\'3f ng\'e0nh sau khi th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3f
t v\u7899\'3fi c\'f5 quan t\'e0i ch\'ednh v\'e0 Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng c\'f9ng c\u7845\'3fp.
\par e. Sau khi b\u7893\'3f sung t\u7915\'3f c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn n\'f3i tr\'ean, n\u7871\'3fu v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc c\'e1c c\'f5 quan c\'f3 th\u7849\'3fm quy\u7873\'3fn n\'f3i tr\'ean duy\u7879
\'3ft ph\u7847\'3fn Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\u7845\'3fp theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th\'f4ng t\'fd Li\'ean B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh - Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng s\u7889\'3f 46 TTLB - NHNN ng\'e0y 6/12/1986 v\u7851\'3fn c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f2n thi\u7871\'3fu th\'ec xin Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7845\'3fp b\u7893\'3f sung \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843
\'3fo v\u7889\'3fn cho x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'ecn}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 h th\'fd
\u7901\'3fng.
\par Ph\u7847\'3fn cho vay trong \'f0\u7883\'3fnh m\u7913\'3fc v\u7889\'3fn l\'fdu \'f0\u7897\'3fng theo ph\u7847\'3fn nh\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh theo c\'e1c ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f tr\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\'e2y v\'e0 quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi Th
\'f4ng t\'fd n\'f3i tr\'ean, nay s\u7869\'3f do Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn v\'e0 x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp th\u7921\'3fc hi\u7879\'3fn theo h\'fd\u7899\'3fng d\u7851\'3fn \'f0\'f3 c\u7911\'3fa Ng
\'e2n h\'e0ng.
\par 3/ Ph\'fd\'f5ng th\u7913\'3fc nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n TSC\'d0 (\'d0i\u7873\'3fu 19 v\'e0 m\u7909\'3fc 2, \'d0i\u7873\'3fu 2 Quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh 217):
\par Nh\u7919\'3fng TSC\'d0 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd b\u7857\'3fng ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch n\u7871\'3fu kh\'f4ng c\u7847\'3fn d\'f9ng th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'ec x
\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp  b\'e1o c\'e1o c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f5 quan qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'fd c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean }{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f0\u7875\'3f \'f0i\u7873\'3fu \'f0\u7897\'3fng cho c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp kh\'e1c theo nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n TSC\'d0 trong ng\'e0nh s\u7917
\'3f d\u7909\'3fng ho\u7863\'3fc cho ph\'e9p b\'e1n (ho\u7863\'3fc cho thu\'ea) cho c\'e1c \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh kh\'e1c ngo\'e0i ng\'e0nh theo gi\'e1 c\u7843\'3f \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc hai b\'ean mua b\'e1n ch\u7845\'3f
p thu\u7853\'3fn, tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f gi\'e1 tr\u7883\'3f c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f2n l\u7841\'3fi c\u7911\'3fa TSC}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'d0 \u7903\'3f th\u7901\'3fi \'f0i\u7875\'3fm b\'e1n. Nh\u7919\'3fng TSC\'d0 n\'e0y n\u7871\'3fu nh\'fd\u7907\'3fng b\'e1n ra ngo\'e0i khu v\u7921\'3fc kinh t\u7871\'3f qu\u7889\'3fc doanh t}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 h\'ec ph\u7843\'3fi c\'f3 \'fd ki\u7871\'3fn tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn c\u7911\'3fa c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f5 quan t\'e0i ch
\'ednh c\'f9ng c\u7845\'3fp. Sau 30 ng\'e0y k\u7875\'3f t\u7915\'3f khi g\u7917\'3fi b\'e1o c\'e1o n\u7871\'3fu c\'e1c c\'f5 quan c\u7845\'3fp tr\'ean kh\'f4ng c\'f3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af605 \ltrch\fcs0 \f605\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'fd ki
