\ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \u7915\'3f c\'e1c ngu\u7891\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn kh\'e1c nh\'fd quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh \u7903\'3f \'f0i\u7875\'3fm \'936\'94 d\'fd\u7899\'3fi \'f0\'e2y \'f0\u7875\'3f b\u7893\'3f sung. Ngu\u7891\'3f
n tr\u7843\'3f n\u7907\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng v\u7873\'3f v\u7889\'3fn vay n\'e0y l\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\'e0 \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB c\u7911\'3fa x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp.
\par Tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp x\'e9t th\u7845\'3fy s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh qu\'e1 t\u7889\'3fn k\'e9m v\'e0 kh\'f4ng c\'f3 hi\u7879\'3fu q\u7911\'3fa th}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'ec x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 th\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng m\u7897\'3ft ph\u7847\'3fn v\u7889
\'3fn kh\u7845\'3fu hao s\u7917\'3fa ch\u7919\'3fa l\u7899\'3fn b\u7893\'3f sung v\'e0o v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\u7873\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd XDCB \'f0\u7875\'3f mua s\u7855\'3fm t\'e0i s\u7843\'3fn c\u7889\'3f \'f0\u7883\'3fnh thay th\u7871
\'3f. Ng\'fd\u7907\'3fc l\u7841\'3fi trong nh\u7919\'3fng tr\'fd\u7901\'3fng h\u7907\'3fp c\u7847\'3fn thi\u7871\'3ft, x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp c\'f3 th\u7875\'3f s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng m\u7897\'3ft ph\u7847\'3fn v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\u7873\'3f
