\'3fn c\'f2n thi\u7871\'3fu.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 Tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f c\'e2n \'f0\u7889\'3fi chung v\u7873\'3f k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn trong ng\'e0
nh. Li\'ean hi\u7879\'3fp c\'e1c x\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp ho\u7863\'3fc T\u7893\'3fng C\'f4ng ty \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ho\'e0 v\u7889\'3fn t\u7921\'3f c\'f3 v\u7873\'3f \'f0\u7847\'3fu t\'fd x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng c\'f5 b\u7843\'3fn t\u7915\'3f
