\par - G\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn th\'f4ng qua c\'e1c h\'ecnh th\u7913\'3fc li\'ean k\u7871\'3ft s\u7843\'3fn xu\u7845\'3ft v\u7899\'3fi c\'e1c }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af613 \ltrch\fcs0 \f613\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid9570899\charrsid2192901 \'f0\'f5n v\u7883\'3f qu\u7889\'3f
