\'3fn c\'e1c cam k\u7871\'3ft v\u7899\'3fi ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi g\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn ho\u7863\'3fc cho vay v\u7889\'3fn.
\par X\'ed nghi\u7879\'3fp \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc quy\u7873\'3fn quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh n\u7897\'3fi dung c\'e1c cam k\u7871\'3ft tr\'ean c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn v\u7899\'3fi ng\'fd\u7901\'3fi  g\'f3p v\u7889\'3fn ho\u7863\'3f
c cho vay v\u7889\'3fn v\u7873\'3f c\'e1c ch\u7871\'3f \'f0\u7897\'3f ho\'e0n v\u7889\'3fn, tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi ho\u7863\'3fc chia s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm (ngo\'e0i ph\u7847\'3fn s\u7843\'3fn ph\u7849\'3fm ch\u7911\'3f y\u7871\'3fu thu\u7897\'3f
c ch\u7881\'3f ti\'eau k\u7871\'3f ho\u7841\'3fch ph\'e1p l\u7879\'3fnh ph\u7843\'3fi ti\'eau th\u7909\'3f theo \'f0\u7883\'3fa ch\u7881\'3f quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh) tr\'ean nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc b\u7843\'3fo \'f0\u7843\'3fm c\'e1c l\u7907\'3fi \'edch: Nh
